WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The ball reaches the outfield. The whole defense moves to help.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
One outfielder gets the ball. A nearby teammate backs up.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The cutoff player becomes a clear target between ball and play.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Make a controlled throw to the cutoff instead of a desperate heave.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
For a deeper hit, a relay helps bring the ball back in.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Listen to your teammates. Get the ball in and protect the bases.
